Clinical Data Atlas — Catalog Metadata License
===============================================

The catalog metadata under this directory (data/raw/, data/catalog/,
data/graph/, data/changelog/) is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt this metadata for any purpose, including
commercially, as long as you give appropriate credit to the Clinical Data
Atlas project (https://github.com/nielspac177/clinical-data-atlas) and
indicate if changes were made.

This license covers the atlas's own catalog metadata only — it grants no
rights to the underlying datasets themselves, which remain governed by
each original source's own license and access terms (see each record's
`url` and `access` fields, and docs/sources.md).

Code in this repository (everything outside data/) is licensed separately
under the MIT License — see /LICENSE.
